Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,de un modelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.19,0:00:33.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,No hay una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,fórmula detrás.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:35.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué lo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,dice?
