Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,veces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:53.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,¿Y los demás
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:54.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,expertos?
